WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.760 --> 00:00:01.519
Simón,

2
00:00:02.640 --> 00:00:03.679
No te culpo.

3
00:00:04.220 --> 00:00:05.200
Es porque no estamos destinados.

4
00:00:05.200 --> 00:00:06.559
Por eso hubo un malentendido.

5
00:00:07.880 --> 00:00:09.199
Todo ha terminado.

6
00:00:10.960 --> 00:00:12.279
No necesitas disculparte

7
00:00:15.320 --> 00:00:16.519
¿Ya no me quieres?

8
00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:19.159
Bueno, ya ves,

9
00:00:20.800 --> 00:00:21.879
I'm filthy now.

10
00:00:24.200 --> 00:00:25.639
You're not filthy.

11
00:00:26.160 --> 00:00:27.519
Sólo límpialo y estarás bien.

12
00:00:28.520 --> 00:00:29.519
Simón,

13
00:00:30.600 --> 00:00:33.199
we've missed each other.

14
00:00:33.200 --> 00:00:34.279
no estés tan triste

15
00:00:35.600 --> 00:00:37.199
for me anymore.

16
00:00:40.760 --> 00:00:41.239
¡No!

17
00:00:42.600 --> 00:00:43.359
claire,

18
00:00:44.680 --> 00:00:46.359
Mientras estés dispuesto a ir conmigo,

19
00:00:46.448 --> 00:00:47.904
Me casaré contigo.

20
00:00:50.120 --> 00:00:50.919
¡Detener!

21
00:00:51.920 --> 00:00:53.199
Did I say you could go?

22
00:00:54.360 --> 00:00:55.959
Realmente tienes un cariño profundo.

23
00:00:56.960 --> 00:00:58.199
Todavía estás interesado en

24
00:00:58.680 --> 00:00:59.639
¿La mujer con la que he jugado?

25
00:01:03.040 --> 00:01:04.039
Simón.

26
00:01:04.040 --> 00:01:04.959
Simon, are you okay?

27
00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.639
No debería decir que eres profundamente afectuoso.

28
00:01:06.640 --> 00:01:07.519
I should say,

29
00:01:07.520 --> 00:01:08.639
te sobreestimas a ti mismo.

30
00:01:08.640 --> 00:01:09.399
Tu...

31
00:01:09.560 --> 00:01:10.479
entra.

32
00:01:11.840 --> 00:01:12.719
Simón,

33
00:01:12.720 --> 00:01:13.239
Espérame.

34
00:01:13.240 --> 00:01:14.679
Voy a tener una charla con él.

35
00:01:14.680 --> 00:01:15.759
then, I'll go with you.
